message:
	"@Hey there! {name(1)}, how have you been!?" next
	"@It's been so long since I've seen you!" next 
	"@ESPECIALLY here in the Church of all places..." next
	"@Remember how when you and your family would come here every week," next 
	"@You would always want to sit next to Lain for the entire Mass?" next 
	"@You two used to be such close friends, sometimes I wonder..." next 
	"@...Well, it makes sense. Friends drift apart all the time," next
	"@Especially as they grow up, don't they?" next 
	menu{
		
		"Lain?" : goto(AskAboutLain)
		default "..." : goto(Nevermind)
		
	}
	
	AskAboutLain:
		"@Hm? How is she? Ah, yes, I should tell you..." next 
		"@Lain's been, well...fine." next 
		"@She has been doing well in school at least..." next
		"@And she also met a lot of people through her Skateboarding club."	next
		"@Lain has been living in a house near her college with some of her friends." next
		"@Just the other day, she even got a job at a nice resteraunt!" next
		"@We even have the chain here, but it's not the location she works at, obvously." next
		"@So if you ever want to try it, just let me know. I promise you its real good!" next
		"@You know, I never had that kind of opportunity when I was your guys' age," next 
		"@So I'm really happy for her!" next 
		"@...But I'm a mother, you know? Of course I miss her so, so much." next
		"@That's just part of being a mother though, having to accept the fact that," next
		"@A bear cub will eventually leave it's mother's den." next
		"@Like, those memories of you and Lain running around my house, playing with..." next
		"@..Uh, legos? and what have you..." next
		"@I really cherish them. I'm so glad you could have been her friend.."next
		"@Especially with how reckless and stubborn she was," next
		"@Lain had trouble making friends...But then she met you." next
		"@So, thank you. For helping my daughter." next
		"@I'm sure your mom would feel the same way, because I remember how timid you were." next
		"@..." next
		"@Anyways, thanks for talking to me today, {name(1)}. It was so nice seeing you again, all grown up!" next
		"@I'll let you go now and get back to my day..." next
		"@Have a great rest of your day."
		end
		
	Nevermind:
		"@..Is something the matter?" next
		"@{name(1)}, You looked like you were about to say something for a second" next
		"@...Are you sure?" next
		"@Well...Just know that I'm here if you want to talk..." next
		"@Don't worry about it though, whatever it was..." next 
		"@Just know that I know you'll be okay. You're a strong person." end
		